# vendor

Files Zenkai loads only when someone adds a CBR comic in Your files, to turn it into a CBZ inside their own browser.

- `unrar.js` and `unrar.wasm`: node-unrar-js 2.0.2 (MIT licence, see `node-unrar-js-LICENSE.md`), bundled into one browser file. It is a WebAssembly build of RARLAB's UnRAR source, which may be used to extract RAR archives freely but not to recreate the RAR compression algorithm.
